    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (Instagram Login API)\nFill these in the **Config** node:\n1. **cloudName** / **uploadPreset** — already filled (Cloudinary).\n2. **igUserId** — your Instagram user_id (from graph.instagram.com/me?fields=user_id).\n3. **igToken** — Instagram access token from app → Instagram → 'API setup with Instagram login' → Add account.\n\nNo Facebook Page or credential needed — the token is read from Config. Refresh the token every ~60 days.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
